  - "Solo l'host pu\xF2 inserire un codice mappa."
  - "Tylko host mo\u017Ce wpisa\u0107 kod mapy."
  - Hanya host yang bisa memasukkan kode peta.
  - Alleen de host kan een kaartcode invoeren.
  - "Bara v\xE4rden kan ange en kartkod."
  - "\u041B\u0438\u0448\u0435 \u0445\u043E\u0441\u0442 \u043C\u043E\u0436\u0435 \u0432\u0432\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438
    \u043A\u043E\u0434 \u043C\u0430\u043F\u0438."
  - "Kun v\xE6rten kan indtaste en kortkode."
  - Bare verten kan skrive inn en kartkode.
  - "Vain is\xE4nt\xE4 voi sy\xF6tt\xE4\xE4 karttakoodin."
  - "Csak a h\xE1zigazda adhat meg p\xE1lyak\xF3dot."
  - "K\xF3d mapy m\u016F\u017Ee zadat jen hostitel."
  - "Harita kodunu yaln\u0131zca ev sahibi girebilir."
  - "Doar gazda poate introduce un cod de hart\u0103."
  - "Ch\u1EC9 ch\u1EE7 ph\xF2ng m\u1EDBi nh\u1EADp \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\xE3 b\u1EA3n
    \u0111\u1ED3."
  - ".\uFE94\uFEC4\uFEF3\uFEAE\uFEA8\uFEDF\uFE8D \uFEB0\uFEE3\uFEAD \uFEDD\uFE8E\uFEA7\uFEA9\uFE87
